# Example calls against a local server.
# Amounts are strings. Do not send JSON numbers.
# Replace the API key printed once by POST /v1/merchants.

### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:4317/health

### Create a merchant (public destination only)
POST http://127.0.0.1:4317/v1/merchants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Northwind Goods",
  "stellar_destination": "GXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX",
  "webhook_url": "http://127.0.0.1:9099/hooks/beekle",
  "webhook_secret": "replace-with-your-own-hmac-secret"
}

### Create an intent
POST http://127.0.0.1:4317/v1/intents
Authorization: Bearer bk_test_replace_me
Idempotency-Key: order-1001-attempt-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": "25.5000000",
  "asset_code": "USDC",
  "asset_issuer": "GBBD47IF6LWK7P7MDEVSCWR7DPUWV3NY3DTQEVFL4NAT4AQH3ZLLFLA5",
  "merchant_order_ref": "order-1001",
  "expires_in_seconds": 1800
}

### Poll
GET http://127.0.0.1:4317/v1/intents/INTENT_ID
Authorization: Bearer bk_test_replace_me

### Public checkout
GET http://127.0.0.1:4317/v1/checkout/INTENT_ID

### Run the observer once
POST http://127.0.0.1:4317/v1/admin/observer/poll
X-Admin-Token: replace-with-a-long-random-token

### Backfill from an earlier cursor without moving the saved cursor
POST http://127.0.0.1:4317/v1/admin/reconciliation/run
X-Admin-Token: replace-with-a-long-random-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account_id": "G...",
  "from_cursor": "",
  "max_pages": 3
}
